tent": " The Sound <span class=\"italic\">tri-</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Consonant clusters like<span class=\"italic\"> tri-</span> are a group of two or more consonants in a syllable that are next to each other, or do not have a vowel between them.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The sound <span class=\"italic\">tri-</span> is often found at the beginning of a word as a prefix.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It consists of the <span class=\"italic\">t</span> , <span class=\"italic\">r</span> and <span class=\"italic\">eye</span> or <span class=\"italic\">i</span> sounds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try saying the three sounds together, one after the other.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice pronouncing the <span class=\"italic\">tri</span>- sound in the following words", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"triangle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"trivial\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tricycle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Trinity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"triathlon\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "This superstition is not trivial.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When are you running your triathlon?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The Trinity is considered sacred by Christians.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Linking Words with the Same Consonant Sound", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Linking words with the same consonant sounds smoothly connect one word to the next when speaking. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When a word ends in a consonant sound and the following word begins with the same consonant sound, we don't pronounce two sounds - both sounds are pronounced together as one.<br/><br/>Practice pronouncing the linking words in the following examples.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":6,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">p-p</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">g-g</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">d-d</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">t-t</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">r-r</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">k-c</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" step parent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big girl\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" red dish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" get ten\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" wear red\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" dark color\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ste<span class=\\\"strong\\\">p</span>arent\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" bi<span class=\\\"strong\\\">g</span>irl\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" re<span class=\\\"strong\\\">d</span>ish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" ge<span class=\\\"strong\\\">t</span>en\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" wea<span class=\\\"strong\\\">r</span>ed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" dar<span class=\\\"strong\\\">c</span>olor\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "So both things seem correct.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It may not be the best time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Christians must take this into consideration", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "common sense", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ability to think and behave in a reasonable way and to make good decisions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't you think that most superstitions are just common sense?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about superstitions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "practical", "type": "name"}, {"content": "useful and sensible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Superstitions are just common sense. I mean, not walking under a ladder seems pretty practical to me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "back story", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a story that tells what led up to the main story or plot (as of a film) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: However, there is some back story to this superstition. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "origins", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the point or place where something begins or is created", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As with many superstitions, the origins of the ladder come from a religious belief.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trinity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of three people or things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The belief is that God is made up of a trinity, the Holy Father, the Holy Son, and the Holy Ghost. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "somewhat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used to make a statement or description less forceful or definite ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Christians believe that the number three is somewhat sacred. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sacred", "type": "name"}, {"content": "worthy of religious worship", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People believe that certain objects are sacred in their religion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sin", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an offense against religious or moral law", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Walking through this triangle was seen as breaking the Trinity and a sin.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trivial", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not important", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So you see, this superstition is not as trivial as it may seem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le17ob04aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Make a poster about your favorite superstitions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use pictures from magazines or online.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use local and cultural superstitions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your work to your classmates.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Did you all have similar things?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give feedback to your partners.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about manners, customs and superstitions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give useful feedback.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present ideas in a clear and interesting way.", "type": "text"}]}]}